{
  "_comment": "Company job boards read by sources/greenhouse.mjs, sources/lever.mjs and sources/ashby.mjs. `board` is the slug in the public API URL (boards-api.greenhouse.io/v1/boards/{board}/jobs, api.lever.co/v0/postings/{board}, api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/{board}). `company` is the display name. `anyLocation: true` keeps every role on that board (the candidate wants to see all Anthropic/OpenAI roles, remote included); everyone else is filtered to Australia / APAC / bare remote via `filters.location`: a location part is kept when it mentions an `au` hint, or says remote/anywhere with no other place name left after removing `remote_noise` words — and never when it mentions a `reject` place (US 'WA' cities are listed there because 'WA' is also Western Australia). Every board is title-filtered against profile/preferences.json target_roles (whole phrase or head noun: engineer/consultant/analyst/scientist) plus `filters.title_words`; titles containing a preferences keywords_penalty term or a `filters.drop_title_words` term are dropped while `drop_senior_titles` is true. Set `enabled: false` to skip a board. Verified 2026-09-12 — see `_verified` on each entry and `_not_on_these_ats` at the bottom.",
